link","href":"RealtimeToken.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RealtimeToken"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The ephemeral token from the server"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"clienttools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"clientTools?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"readonly "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AnyClientTool.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyClientTool"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional client-side tools to register with the provider"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"RealtimeConnection.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RealtimeConnection"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A connection instance"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"provider","children":[{"type":"text","value":"provider"}]},{"type":"code","value":"provider: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L321","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:321"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider identifier"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"connect","text":"connect","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"token","text":"token","level":5},{"id":"clienttools","text":"clientTools?","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"provider","text":"provider","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:319](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L319)\n\nAdapter interface for connecting to realtime providers.\nEach provider (OpenAI, ElevenLabs, etc.) implements this interface.\n\nDefined here in `@tanstack/ai` — the shared layer that both provider adapter\npackages and the client runtime (`@tanstack/ai-client`) already depend on —\nso a provider package can describe its realtime adapter without taking a\ndependency on the client-only `@tanstack/ai-client`. `@tanstack/ai-client`\nre-exports this type for backwards compatibility.\n\n## Properties\n\n### connect\n\n```ts\nconnect: (token, clientTools?) => Promise<RealtimeConnection>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:329](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L329)\n\nCreate a connection using the provided token\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### token\n\n[`RealtimeToken`](RealtimeToken.md)\n\nThe ephemeral token from the server\n\n##### clientTools?\n\nreadonly [`AnyClientTool`](../type-aliases/AnyClientTool.md)[]\n\nOptional client-side tools to register with the provider\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`RealtimeConnection`](RealtimeConnection.md)\\>\n\nA connection instance\n\n***\n\n### provider\n\n```ts\nprovider: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:321](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L321)\n\nProvider identifier\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RealtimeAdapter\ntitle: RealtimeAdapter\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:319](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L319)\n\nAdapter interface for connecting to realtime providers.\nEach provider (OpenAI, ElevenLabs, etc.) implements this interface.\n\nDefined here in `@tanstack/ai` — the shared layer that both provider adapter\npackages and the client runtime (`@tanstack/ai-client`) already depend on —\nso a provider package can describe its realtime adapter without taking a\ndependency on the client-only `@tanstack/ai-client`. `@tanstack/ai-client`\nre-exports this type for backwards compatibility.\n\n## Properties\n\n### connect\n\n```ts\nconnect: (token, clientTools?) => Promise<RealtimeConnection>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:329](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L329)\n\nCreate a connection using the provided token\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### token\n\n[`RealtimeToken`](RealtimeToken.md)\n\nThe ephemeral token from the server\n\n##### clientTools?\n\nreadonly [`AnyClientTool`](../type-aliases/AnyClientTool.md)[]\n\nOptional client-side tools to register with the provider\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`RealtimeConnection`](RealtimeConnection.md)\\>\n\nA connection instance\n\n***\n\n### provider\n\n```ts\nprovider: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts:321](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/realtime/types.ts#L321)\n\nProvider identifier\n"}
